      "content": "u sure though? i read online that it's just a natural herb so it shouldn't really mess with synthetic stuff like that. i'm not really looking to go to the doctor for something like this since it's just seasonal stuff, i'd rather just try the supplement first and see. isn't it mostly just safe for most people?",
